(
    title: "CocoNuts",
    description: Some("Coco the monkey pelts jungle explorer Stanley I. Presume with coconuts from the treetops while you dart side to side to make every throw miss — each dodged coconut scores, and the volleys pay more as they fly faster. Stanley\'s umbrella and pith helmet absorb the first two hits and are won back at score milestones, but one blow to the bare head ends the game; each rest only makes Coco madder and his next series quicker."),
